# ===================================================================================== the film ===
splash 0
wav 21-set.wav
film 21-set.film
tlog 21-set-tlog.txt
bar 0 1 HOARFROST: the launch screen; the set starts with it, the first intro
splashrun
expect view 0
expect screen 0
expect filter 0
# The launch screen's run starts the music by itself, as the FM-1 at power-on: here, Set mode on slot 4, the first
# song's intro from the top. Its UI starts again too (the DJ filter at Off), so the filter is shut now, on camera, as
# the intro's first sounds come: Shut 30, opened over the intro's last phrase
spin SELECT -32
expect filter -30
wait 200
expect playing 1
expect song 1
# ------------------------------------------------------ 1 Hoarfrost (D minor, 120, bars 0-311) ---
